      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Having lunch with Natasha, Elena praises Victor's restaurant—until Natasha points across the dining room at Barinov parading in a French maid's uniform after losing his card rematch to Mikhail. Mortified, Elena walks out despite Victor's explanations.",
